  (limitation "Twelve finite predeclared witnesses of the eleven load and store forms: each load's extension read at a value with its sign bit set, and each store read back, a store writing no GPR; byte offsets assume REQ-D-ENDIAN's little-endian order; alignment, faults and translation are not witnessed; full source/risk/feature policy remains pending.")
  (source_id "RVI-RV64I") (source_locator "3.1.3") (category "defined") (risk "high")
  (coverage "twelve witnesses: seven loads, four stores read back, and a second read")
